      "ranges": [[41, 60]]
    },
    {
      "worker": 4,
      "brief": "You have rows 61‑70 of the ledger (line items). For each line, determine the unit rate: if the line provides a unit_rate use it; otherwise retrieve the unit_rate for its rate_code from the rate table (rows 1‑10). Compute amount_owed = qty × unit_rate. If paid is less than amount_owed, record the line as UNDERPAID and calculate shortfall = amount_owed – paid (two‑decimal precision). Also record every claim_id you encounter. Return a JSON object with two arrays: \"underpaid\" (objects with row, line_id, claim_id, shortfall) and \"claims\" (list of claim_id strings).",
      "ranges": [[61, 70]]
    }
  ]
